{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","索尼娅"],["/names/en","Sonja"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英姿飒爽的战士，可以与友军缔结盟约，并将自己的力量与盟友分享。"],["/description_i18n/en","A dashing Warrior who forms alliances and shares power with allies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我允许你放下武器。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll allow you to surrender."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这很珍贵，谢谢。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","A fine choice. Thank you."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","哼，轮到你了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Time for you to feel the pain."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","有趣。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","That was fun..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","这不算什么。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","This was nothing."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","无论是客人还是敌人，请别挡路。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","No matter friend or foe, stay outta my way."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","怎么，有情况？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Tell me. Did something happen?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯？……失礼了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Hmmm...? *Sigh* Excuse me..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","我不是天生的强者。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/en","I wasn't born strong."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你的心意，我看到了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I see you've put in some thought."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我收下了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I'll accept it."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","血薇之主"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Crimson Queenpin"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","愿血薇永不凋谢。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","May the Carmine Whispers stay in bloom forever."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","白薇戎装"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Pristine Valor"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","利刃与铁律之上，白金色的蔷薇傲然绽放。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","A platinum rose blooms in defiance, rising above blades and iron law."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","金玫瑰高定商店兑换获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Rosy Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Legendary"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里很热闹"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's lively here."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","偶尔放松一下，也不坏"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Sometimes it's nice to relax."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","和锈锚港的海味不同……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It tastes different from the flavors in Rustport..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","能感到节日的气息……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I can feel the excitement in the air."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节，团聚……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The Winter Carnival is for reunions with family..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下次也这么装饰吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's decorate like this next time at the office."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","得去安排下防火……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I should check if they have a fire extinguisher..."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅在进入血薇帮前是孤儿，和妹妹奈拉相依为命。但很少有人知道，她和奈拉没有血缘关系。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Before joining the Carmine Whispers, Sonja was just another orphan, scrapping her way through the streets of Rustport with Nara. Though they were inseparable, almost no one knew they weren't bound by blood."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","无父无母的孤儿在锈锚港的日子并不好过，为了讨生活，索尼娅剪掉了自己的长发。由于看不到，她剪得歪歪扭扭，最后是由奈拉代劳的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Life at Rustport was merciless for orphans. To survive, Sonja had to cut off her long hair, hacking away unevenly until Nara quietly took the scissors and finished the job."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅知道作为一个领导者，没有弱点是致命的。虽然她没有特别的喜好，但她会每天清晨摘一朵血薇放在自己床头。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","As a leader, Sonja knows that weakness is a luxury she can't afford. She has no particular likes, but she places a single carmine rose by her bedside every morning—a ritual only she understands."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅当上血薇帮老大后，锈锚港的治安秩序好了很多，不少孤儿也得到了教育的机会和稳定的食物供给。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Since she became the head of the Carmine Whispers, Rustport has changed. Streets once ruled by chaos now have some order, and orphans have access to education and a steady supply of food."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅早早给自己买好了墓地，那是在一个山坡上，能眺望到海的地方。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Sonja's already reserved a burial plot for herself. It's on a hillside with a view of the sea."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","小时候，索尼娅会带奈拉去海边放纸船，纸船上放上种子，花瓣，泥土，还有布娃娃，奈拉管这叫新家。看着纸船飘飘摇摇地载着她们的梦向远方去，是她们童年难得的惬意时光。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Sonja would take Nara to the beach, where they'd send little paper boats afloat, filled with petals, seeds, soil, and even dolls. Watching the boats carry their wishes out to sea was a rare moment of peace in their young lives."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅无论学什么都刻苦，因此很快在血薇帮收养的一众孩子里脱颖而出。她迫切希望自己能迅速变强，强到能在一次次梦见海难时，能牢牢抓住奈拉的手。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Sonja's fierce determination set her apart among the Carmine Whispers' adopted children. Every day, she fought to become stronger, haunted by nightmares of shipwrecks where she could barely hold onto Nara's hand."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅时常站在高处眺望锈锚港，海上的船只、来往的行人、嬉戏的孩童，还有正在敲诈游人的混混，一切都在眼底时，她仿佛透过这些人，也能看到自己的命运。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","From above Rustport, Sonja watches her domain—ships in the harbor, travelers, children at play, gang thugs on the prowl—and sees her own fate reflected in their lives."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","血薇帮的人都畏惧索尼娅，也害怕和她对视，只有卢卡不怕，索尼娅第一次见到卢卡的时候，就知道自己找到了半个同类。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","In the gang, Sonja's reputation precedes her. No one dares meet her gaze, save for Lucca. From the moment they met, she knew she'd found something close to a kindred spirit."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","索尼娅是击败了其他候选人后，才被选为继承人的。当泰西欧把象征权力的血薇别在她胸口时，她既不快乐，也不悲伤，只觉得疲惫。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Sonja became the Carmine Whispers' heir only after defeating all other candidates. When Tesio pinned the carmine rose emblem over her heart, she felt no joy or sorrow—only exhaustion."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","索尼娅姐姐，今天晚上我可以和你一起睡吗……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Sonja, can I sleep with you tonight?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411180.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411180.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","奈拉 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Nara & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯坎迪亚群岛"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Scandia Isles"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","魔法能让人死而复生吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Can magic bring people back to life?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411190.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411190.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Sonja & Chippy & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯坎迪亚群岛"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Scandia Isles"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","满满捡到了很多漂亮的羽毛！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Chippy found a lot of beautiful feathers!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411220.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411220.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Sonja & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯坎迪亚群岛"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Scandia Isles"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","嘻嘻，才不给你呢，这是给索尼娅姐姐的！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Haha, I'm not giving it to you! It's for Sonja!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411250.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411250.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","奈拉 & 满满 & 索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Nara & Chippy & Sonja & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯坎迪亚群岛"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Scandia Isles"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","When I was young, I was a beggar, a thief, and a pickpocket. I even fought stray dogs for scraps of bread."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411260.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411260.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Sonja & Hammie & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯坎迪亚群岛"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Scandia Isles"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","索尼娅，满满在废墟里找到了这个！好像是血薇帮的标志！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Sonja, Chippy found this in the ruins! This seems to be the logo of Carmine Whispers!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411270.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411270.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Blackthorn Sea"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Do you know what Greenbrook used to be like?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411310.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Sonja & Hammie & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Blackthorn Sea"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队……呵，他们抓了不少我的兄弟姐妹。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Dead Tide Fleet... Hmph, they have captured many of my peers."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411320.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411320.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Blackthorn Sea"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","死潮舰队留下的实验记录，真是越看越让人心惊……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","The more I read the experimental notes of the Dead Tide Fleet, the more unnerving they become..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411350.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Blackthorn Sea"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","自从死潮舰队的人踏上锈锚港的那一天，我就等着把他们斩杀殆尽的这一刻。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Since the day the Dead Tide Fleet disembarked at Rustport, I've been waiting for this moment to wipe them out."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411370.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411370.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Sonja & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","黑棘海"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Blackthorn Sea"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","刚送来的消息：泰西欧很不安分，嚷着要见你。"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Here's the latest update: Tesio is making a scene and demanding to see you."],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411380.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411380.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","卢卡 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Lucca & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","索尼娅，击败死潮舰队，锈锚港恢复平静之后，你有什么计划呢？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Sonja, peaceful days have returned to Rustport after you defeated the Dead Tide Fleet. What's next for you?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep2/herohub_story/12411430.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/ep2/herohub_story/12411430.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","斯托密海峡"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Stormy Strait"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","挑食会营养不良，这对你不好。"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Being a picky eater could lead to malnutrition, you know. That's not good for you."],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415037.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415037.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅 & 奈拉"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Sonja & Nara"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","一个人喝酒，这可不像你，索尼娅。"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Drinking alone? How like you, Sonja."],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415038.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415038.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","辛巴达 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Sinbad & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","你是难缠的对手，但你还不够格成为那万中无一。"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","You're a tough one, I'll grant you that—but don't flatter yourself. You're hardly exceptional."],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415041.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415041.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","霍德希金 & 索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Hodgkin & Sonja"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","这里很热闹"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","It's lively here."],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415324.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415324.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","和锈锚港的海味不同……"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","It tastes different from the flavors in Rustport..."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415325.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415325.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","能感到节日的气息……"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","I can feel the excitement in the air."],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415359.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415359.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节，团聚……"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","The Winter Carnival is for reunions with family..."],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415360.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415360.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","下次也这么装饰吧"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/en","Let's decorate like this next time at the office."],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415527.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415527.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/en","Sonja"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","得去安排下防火……"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/en","I should check if they have a fire extinguisher..."],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415528.json"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415528.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","索尼娅"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/en","Sonja"]]}